# Citations for Category cat11

## 1. [bathla2024] Explainable 3D CNN Model for Glioma Classification: Comparison with Radiologists

**Authors:** Bathla P, et al.
**Year:** 2024
**Source:** Expert Rev Med Devices
**PMID:** 37977889 (https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37977889/)

> 3D CNN with Grad-CAM. 40% of disagreements due to model using features not weighted by radiologists.

